---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+18435550199';
const phoneDisplay = '(843) 555-0199';
---
<Layout title="Dusty Home | Air Duct Cleaning Charleston SC" description="Dust returns quickly? Air duct cleaning in Charleston, SC can reduce recirculated particles.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Dusty Home</h1>
      <p>A common reason Charleston homeowners schedule duct cleaning.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container content-block">
      <p>If dust reappears on surfaces within days of cleaning, particles trapped in your ductwork may be recirculating every time the system runs. Professional cleaning removes that reservoir of debris.</p>
      <h2>How Cleaning Helps</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Removes accumulated dust from supply and return lines</li>
        <li>Reduces the amount of particles blown into living spaces</li>
        <li>Works best alongside good filtration and regular filter changes</li>
      </ul>
      <p style="margin-top:1.5rem"><a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Call {phoneDisplay}</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
